CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract-rec f
^\[f.array_parameter.\d+\].*function argument failure: pointer outside object bounds.*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Checks that DFCC removes static metadata only from calls made directly by the
proof harness, retaining the C call contract on recursive calls.
